# Local env files
# - .env / .env.local etc are gitignored (real secrets).
# - *.example templates are committed.
# - .env.production.filled is the script-generated upload bundle and
#   contains real secrets — never commit it.
.env
.env.*
!.env*.example
.env.production.filled
.vercel
.env*.local
